HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ddeevvccttll utility first appeared in FreeBSD 10.3.

BBUUGGSS
     Currently there is no administrative flag to prevent re-attach or resume
     of the manually detached or suspended devices after reset.  Similarly,
     there is no flag to prevent un-suspending of the manually suspended de‐
     vices after system resume.

